{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）上午6時50分，土瓜灣帝庭豪園單位一名女子暈倒，其家人報警求助。人員接報到場，49歲姓李女子昏迷被送往廣華醫院搶救，惜被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><figure><img alt=\"廣華醫院。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260917/1177191944246398976358470.jpeg/Fj8iD4Clc9goaur5T2503U_vXrb4xUXH50K41udCuNY\"/><figcaption>廣華醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帝庭豪園。（google地圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220528/607260779300917248809327.jpeg/ZnNC5XkxCc4Upm2qEv9d86znW8MLCAmcK8-tyyvPrcs\"/><figcaption>帝庭豪園。（google地圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T03:58:21.298170+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}